#: src/js/library.js:19
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lunarNotice"
msgid "Staff update full-moon availability on the night. Check the catalogue before visiting."
msgstr "満月時の利用状況は当夜に更新します。来館前に目録をご確認ください。"

